sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant User
participant MainWindow
participant CommandActionManager
participant ApplicationImpl
participant Project
participant BusinessManager
participant PreferenceManager
participant ProjectStorage
participant ProjectArchiveService

User->>MainWindow: Click "Export Project"
MainWindow->>CommandActionManager: Execute(Project.Export)
CommandActionManager->>ApplicationImpl: ExportProject(targetFile)
ApplicationImpl->>Project: Export(targetFile)
Project->>PreferenceManager: SaveProjectConfig()
Project->>BusinessManager: SaveAll(context)
Project->>ProjectStorage: FlushPendingFiles()
Project->>ProjectArchiveService: PackProject(root, targetFile)
ProjectArchiveService-->>Project: ExportCompleted
Project-->>ApplicationImpl: ProjectExported
ApplicationImpl->>MainWindow: ShowExportResult()
